{
  "bookId": "rewind-20",
  "id": "chapter-86",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22623001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人，你终于回来啦……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22623003",
              "text": "怎么了，委屈巴巴的？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22623002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……呜呜，优纪以为自己再也见不到主人啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人……你不在家的时候，优纪被坏人绑走了，差一点就死掉了，多亏了「蒂娅」，是「蒂娅」救了我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22623007",
              "text": "你好，蒂娅，谢谢你，非常感谢。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22623006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "（……心在跳动……这是什么感觉？）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "（很像……熟悉又温柔的语气……）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "（眼前这个人类……会是我要寻找的……「那个人」吗？）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22623011",
              "text": "蒂娅，蒂娅？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22623010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……噢，抱歉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22623013",
              "text": "怎么了，是我脸上沾了东西吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22623012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "对、对不起，我有……一点出厂故障，\n……偶尔会进入无意识的休眠。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "欸？怎么会这样？！是……是出荷的时候撞到了吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "是原著带来的后遗症，她是战斗机型，据说因为战斗能耗太大，所以需要经常休眠呢——对吧，头儿？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "嗯……是这样的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这样阿，对了主人，蒂娅她超厉害的！轻轻松松就把那么多坏蛋给打飞了，还有还有阿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "再就是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「出厂故障」？「无意识休眠」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "——哎，头儿，你今天不太对劲阿？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "说话磕磕巴巴，脸红得也很可疑，该不会是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22623022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "没有的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-497",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "blackyouji",
          "rowIds": [
            22623001,
            22623002,
