      ],
      "title": "歧途之宴·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22624001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "时间不早了，我们也该走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "欸……等等，这么晚了……留下来休息一下吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "而且我们马上就要举办超大的庆宴了，大家都会来的，你愿意……一起参加吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22624005",
              "text": "留下来吧，大家都很喜欢你呢~"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22624004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "超大的庆宴吗，那也不错，我看我们就多呆几天好了，正好可以彼此熟悉一下呢——对吧，头儿？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "喂……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "太好啦！那就说定啦！\n蒂娅……你现在累了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "还好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "跟我来，我想带你去一个地方~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，已经这么晚……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没关系，有蒂娅和我在一起呢~安心啦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "闭上眼噢，很快就到了，小心台阶——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "迈过来一点，在这里坐下，好了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "锵锵——！怎么样怎么样，很不错吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "星星……好漂亮……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿~这是优纪的秘密基地哦，开心的时候、有烦恼的时候都会偷偷来这里，连和江都不知道呢~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "但不知道为什么，第一眼看见你的时候……就想带你来看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "总觉得，你身上有一种熟悉的味道……虽然这么说有些冒昧，但这种感觉就像是，我们认识了很久一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……噗，哈呵呵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "欸……果、果然很好笑吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "不是的，我也这样觉得——好像已经认识你很久了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那优纪真是世界上最幸福的人了！\n你看那边，启明星升起来了……真好阿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624024",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "（终于见到你了，「优纪」。）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22624025",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "（原来是这样，这样充满活力的无忧无虑的女孩子阿……）",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-498",
