        }
      ],
      "title": "歧途之宴·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22626001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "很香呢，这位大厨，这是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈莉特制「涂料烧烤」！手办也能「体验」的美食盛宴！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "黄色是榴莲口味，红色是草莓口味，绿色是青苹果口味~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "嗯~真是有趣~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "像真正的美食一样呢，劳驾劳驾，让我过去一下，不介意吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "当然。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "不要出声，你跟我来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "新串好的鲱鱼罐头口味，有人要吗——\n欸，她们两个到哪里去？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "大概有什么悄悄话吧——嘿，给我一个金枪鱼配水果口味。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "你怎么在这？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "当然是正大光明，接受了派对的邀请，\n刚才你也在场，不是么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "水城结奈在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "她不太喜欢这种场合，尤其是……面对这么多活蹦乱跳的，小玩意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "为什么回到M城？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "这句话还轮不到你来发问，「异乡人」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "我知道你在找什么，花鸟原，或者该叫你——「S-VIII」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……哼，消息倒很灵通。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "有一件事我不明白。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "如果我猜得不错，那单「运送货物」的委托人，就是你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "身为「天启十一众」，却刻意引我们前去破坏阿撒兹勒的计划——为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "啧，被你发现了阿，\n想给阿撒兹勒找点乐子罢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……你究竟站在哪边，你们真正的目的是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "我是个生意人，也是你的委托人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "蒂娅，蒂娅——咦，你们看到蒂娅了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "不走吗，你的小女孩在找你呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "噢对了，关于委托的报酬，「能量石的线索」对吧？\n派对结束后，我会派人答复你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22626028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呵呵~合，作，愉，快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-500",
      "sourceRefs": [
